# Data files.
# The multi-hundred-megabyte originals in Course 04/datasets/raw/ stay OUT of the repo.
# What DOES ship is one committed sample of each (Course 04/datasets/samples/) plus the
# small real files. tools/data.py loads whichever is present and prints which one it used,
# so a student who clones the repo is never blocked. See Course 04/datasets/DATA.md.
data/
*.csv
*.parquet
*.npy
*.npz
/tmp/

# ... except these, which are course INPUTS and must be in the repository:
!Course 04/datasets/samples/*.csv
!Course 04/datasets/raw/titanic.csv
